# A Postgres bind mount, if anyone swaps the named volume for one. Anchored to the repository root
# and nothing else: an unanchored `data/` also matches src/Api/Data on a case-insensitive
# filesystem, which silently excluded the entire EF model and every migration from the repository.
/data/
